OL,3,GNEWSAFentanyl 'serial killer' review
OL,4,Aclosed by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives have closed a review into
OL,7,Fwhether fentanyl murderer Luke D'Wit
OL,8,Fwas a serial killer, the BBC can
OL,9,Freveal.
OL,11,FD'Wit, 37, is serving life with a
OL,12,Fminimum term of 37 years for the
OL,13,Fmurders of Stephen and Carol Baxter who
OL,14,Fhe befriended before poisoning them at
OL,15,Ftheir home in West Mersea.
OL,17,FEssex Police examined the deaths of his
OL,18,Ffather and grandfather after his
OL,19,Fconviction in 2024 and considered
OL,20,Fbringing new charges against him,
OL,21,Falthough it is unclear what they
OL,22,Frelated to.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
