OL,3,GNEWSAFentanyl 'serial killer' review
OL,4,Aclosed by police
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have consulted with the Crown
OL,7,FProsecution Service (CPS) and at this
OL,8,Fstage we are not seeking to bring
OL,9,Fadditional prosecutions against Luke
OL,10,FD'Wit," it said.
